<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield eases to 21.74 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield eases to 21.74 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.74 percent, down from 21.83 percent two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     19,367.38 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   12,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		13,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.74 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     90.2685 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
